# 📝 To-Do List Frontend

This repository contains the frontend of the To-Do List web application, built using **React** and **Tailwind CSS**.

---

## 🔧 Tech Stack

- **Frontend Framework:** React.js  
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS  
- **State Management:** React Hooks  
- **Authentication:** JWT  
- **Version Control:** Git & GitHub  

---

## ⚙️ Features

- Responsive UI for managing tasks and notes  
- User login and registration integrated with backend JWT authentication  
- CRUD operations for notes (create, read, update, delete)  
- Categories and filtering options for notes  
- Secure personal vault for private notes  

---

## 🚀 Getting Started

1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/Suchitra-V31/todo-frontend.git

